{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "39cd0d97-a3dd-83e5-b3b5-fc8b7ceb8315",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T18:58:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:55:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. This is Rosemarie Fiore. I'm calling because the streetlight in front of 174 Rhode Island Avenue has been on all day, and I'd like a crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 174 Rhode Island Avenue. And the light is on during the daytime, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It stays on all day. I noticed it Monday morning and it was still on this morning. It doesn't shut off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So since Monday, so that would be after the snow and rain coming through on Sunday into Monday. Was it doing this before the storm, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. It was normal before that. It came on at night and went off in the morning. Since the storm it hasn't gone off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it a light on a utility pole, or one of the city's own poles? Do you happen to see a number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on a wooden pole at the curb. I don't see a number from here. I would have to go out and look, and it's dark and icy out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, don't go out in that. I'll put down the address and the pole being in front of the house. Is it right at 174, or closer to a neighbor's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:56:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's directly in front of 174. I'm the neighbor next door, so I see it from my window. I'm calling you now because I have a lull between deliveries at work. I'm a stock clerk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, so you're on a break. That works. And I know you're calling the storm line, since it's after hours at City Hall. We keep this line going for these things. I'll get it logged tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I know City Hall is closed. I was told to use this number for after hours. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's perfectly fine. So let me read it back. Streetlight in front of 174 Rhode Island Avenue, Historic Hill, on all day since Monday morning, after the storm. You'd like a crew to check the pole. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is there any sparking, buzzing, or anything leaning or down? Any wires hanging?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:57:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. The pole looks straight. No wires down that I can see. It's only the light."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then it goes in as a regular repair request, not an emergency. I can't tell you the exact day a crew will get there, they've been busy since the storm, but it'll be on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Should I give you a number in case they need to reach me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:24-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180, and it's for Rosemarie Fiore, F-I-O-R-E?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I've got everything. If the light goes off or anything changes, you can call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. I have to go, the truck is here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, take care, Ms. Fiore. Goodnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T18:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodnight."
    }
  ],
